flowchart LR
  subgraph Without["Without a workflow"]
    direction TB
    U1[Developer]
    AI1[AI chat]
    U1 -->|vague ask| AI1
    AI1 -->|guess code| U1
    U1 -->|fix &amp; re-ask| AI1
    AI1 -->|new guess| U1
    note1["No memory<br/>No stack<br/>No phase<br/>No yesterday"]
  end

  subgraph With["With a workflow"]
    direction TB
    U2[Developer]
    CTX[(Project context<br/>persona + stack + phase)]
    AI2[AI chat]
    U2 -->|slash command| CTX
    CTX -->|grounded prompt| AI2
    AI2 -->|stack-aware code| U2
    U2 -->|/next-session| CTX
    note2["Persistent state<br/>Stack rules loaded<br/>Knows the phase<br/>Knows yesterday"]
  end

  Without ~~~ With

  classDef bad fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,color:#000;
  classDef good fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#000;
  classDef ctx fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,color:#000;
  class Without bad;
  class With good;
  class CTX ctx;
